      <activity id="4e565359-4645-5074-9567-fac8bf8a7b71" activityNameId="7b3ffd61-4efe-517f-8107-7bd8d9561db7" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Window frame, wood-metal, opaquely painted, frame cover, m2 visible, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Window frame, wood-metal, opaquely painted, frame cover, m2 visible, at plant
The measures of the window are 1.75m (width) x 1.3m (height). The average visible area is 0.29m2. The bill of materials is based on data from 4 window producers.;
UUID: 53e30a84-872f-38bb-9945-703e404e15cb
Included are the materials used in a wooden-metal window frame with surface treatment and the panelling of the frame. Production losses, work materials, packaging materials, energy demand and the transport of the materials are also included.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Industry data.
Time period: Time of publications
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data survey at 4 window manufacturers in Switzerland. 
Extrapolations: Some generic datasets from ecoinvent have been used.
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_53e30a84-872f-38bb-9945-703e404e15cb.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
